WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.227 --> 00:00:16.748
and Kashe were walking through the desert shrubs with Gau.

2
00:00:18.269 --> 00:00:20.869
The other men were hunting in a different area.

3
00:00:20.889 --> 00:00:26.111
"It is not good to hunt with too many people," explained Kashe.

4
00:00:26.131 --> 00:00:28.891
"Animals are very clever.

5
00:00:29.612 --> 00:00:32.481
They have good ears and can quickly smell hunters."

6
00:00:33.962 --> 00:00:35.002
Vinnie was scared.

7
00:00:35.443 --> 00:00:37.544
Kashe had given him a bow and arrow.

8
00:00:38.724 --> 00:00:40.866
But Vinnie did not know how to use it.

9
00:00:41.226 --> 00:00:42.727
He remembered the hyenas.

10
00:00:44.247 --> 00:00:45.608
"How often do you hunt?"

11
00:00:46.108 --> 00:00:46.769
asked Vinnie.

12
00:00:46.789 --> 00:00:51.071
"When we need food," replied Kashe.

13
00:00:52.432 --> 00:00:54.213
"Usually we start early in the morning.

14
00:00:55.514 --> 00:00:57.175
But today I saw you and Mandy.

15
00:00:58.075 --> 00:00:59.516
I had to return to the village."

16
00:01:00.816 --> 00:01:02.117
Suddenly he stopped.

17
00:01:03.038 --> 00:01:06.280
On the ground was a pile of something that smelled bad.

18
00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:09.522
"Is that what I think it is?"

19
00:01:09.983 --> 00:01:10.643
asked Vinnie.

20
00:01:11.844 --> 00:01:13.645
He pinched his nose at the smell.

21
00:01:14.866 --> 00:01:16.887
Kashe and Gau looked at each other.

22
00:01:16.907 --> 00:01:19.749
"The animal dung is fresh.

23
00:01:20.230 --> 00:01:22.331
They are close," Kashe said.

24
00:01:22.351 --> 00:01:26.114
"Kashe, look here."

25
00:01:26.694 --> 00:01:28.956
Gau pointed to another pile of dung.

26
00:01:30.684 --> 00:01:33.406
"This is also fresh," Kashe replied.

27
00:01:33.426 --> 00:01:35.107
"That is not good."

28
00:01:36.448 --> 00:01:37.649
Vinnie was curious.

29
00:01:37.669 --> 00:01:39.070
"What is it?"

30
00:01:39.550 --> 00:01:40.091
he asked.

31
00:01:41.752 --> 00:01:46.435
Kashe pointed to the first pile and said, "That dung is from antelope."

32
00:01:47.976 --> 00:01:49.877
Then he pointed to the second pile.

33
00:01:49.897 --> 00:01:52.279
"But this belongs to a rhino."

34
00:01:53.600 --> 00:01:55.561
Kashe got his bow and arrow ready.

35
00:01:55.581 --> 00:02:01.273
"We must be very careful," he said, as he slowly walked on.

36
00:02:01.293 --> 00:02:04.214
"Rhinos are very dangerous."

37
00:02:06.315 --> 00:02:11.437
Back at the village, Mandy and the women poured their shelled nuts into a big pile.

38
00:02:12.957 --> 00:02:14.218
Women brought out pots.

39
00:02:14.238 --> 00:02:18.520
"Let's get water," Twi said to Mandy.

40
00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:22.861
She held two white balls and gave one to Mandy.

41
00:02:23.562 --> 00:02:24.802
It had a funny smell.

42
00:02:24.822 --> 00:02:27.163
"What's this?"

43
00:02:28.044 --> 00:02:28.784
Mandy asked.

44
00:02:30.248 --> 00:02:33.151
"It's the shell of an ostrich egg," Twi said.

45
00:02:33.171 --> 00:02:36.934
"We use it to carry water for our meals."

46
00:02:38.596 --> 00:02:40.698
Twi led Mandy to a water hole.

47
00:02:42.019 --> 00:02:44.301
It contained only a little bit of water.

48
00:02:44.321 --> 00:02:47.684
"Is this all the water you have?"

49
00:02:48.404 --> 00:02:49.245
Mandy asked.

50
00:02:50.747 --> 00:02:54.250
She wondered how these people could live with so little water.

51
00:02:55.871 --> 00:02:56.592
Twi nodded.

52
00:02:57.172 --> 00:03:00.013
"Our people are travelers, like you and Vinnie.

53
00:03:00.613 --> 00:03:02.154
We journey to find water."

54
00:03:03.755 --> 00:03:06.936
She bent down and scooped some water into the eggshell.

55
00:03:06.956 --> 00:03:12.018
"This water is almost gone, so we will be moving soon."

56
00:03:13.879 --> 00:03:17.300
Mandy filled her eggshell and followed Twi to the village.

57
00:03:18.801 --> 00:03:21.322
Vinnie was careful to stay close to Kashe.

58
00:03:22.662 --> 00:03:26.144
Suddenly Kashe and Gau ran behind a large bush.

59
00:03:27.548 --> 00:03:28.469
Vinnie joined them.

60
00:03:29.009 --> 00:03:30.290
Kashe pointed ahead.

61
00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:33.892
"Oh!" Vinnie gasped.

62
00:03:35.512 --> 00:03:38.734
He saw a peaceful herd of antelope and zebras.

63
00:03:40.255 --> 00:03:44.077
Just then Kashe and Gau stood up and aimed their arrows.

64
00:03:45.658 --> 00:03:48.600
The animals sensed the hunters and started to run.

65
00:03:50.100 --> 00:03:51.961
The men shot their poison arrows.

66
00:03:53.542 --> 00:03:56.264
One hit an antelope, which kept running.

67
00:03:57.645 --> 00:03:59.451
Kashe and Gau chased after it.

68
00:03:59.972 --> 00:04:00.394
So did
